# Planner one-step TRT engine build (Jetson AGX Orin, trtexec), bf16 with a
# dynamic scene-length axis. Profile spans the certified manifests: r640 scenes
# sit at S in [1745..1750], f2 scenes at S in [1139..1142] (scene-KV lengths).
# Single-manifest consumers can tighten min/max (f2-only: 1139/1142).
#
# Input: planner ONNX from export/planner/export_planner_onnx.py --dynamic.
# Builder: export/planner/build_planner_engine.sh (consumes these variables).
QD_PLANNER_S_MIN=1139
QD_PLANNER_S_OPT=1748
QD_PLANNER_S_MAX=1750
